      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Optogenetics established an exceptionally powerful causal method for physiology, transforming the ability to interrogate defined cells and circuits.",
        "attribution": "The channelrhodopsin discovery and its conversion into a broadly usable genetic optical-control method provide a coherent, though wider than three-person, attribution story.",
        "maturity": "Its impact is extensive across basic biology and biomedicine, with durable methodological and conceptual importance.",
